@startuml
title TVM - Component Diagram (Updated: REST to Back-Office + MQTT Publish)

package "TVM Application" {

  [SaleRequestHandler] as Handler
  [TicketSaleService] as Service

  [BackOfficeRestClient] as Rest
  [MqttClientAdapter] as Mqtt
  [JsonSerializer] as Json
  [JsonFileLogger] as Log
}

node "Back-Office System" as BO
cloud "Mosquitto Broker" as Broker

' User input flow
Handler --> Service : processSale(validityDays, lineNumber)\n(valid only)

' REST flow (ticket creation)
Service --> Rest : POST /api/v1/tickets\n{validityDays,lineNumber}
Rest --> BO : HTTP request
BO --> Rest : HTTP response\n(ticketId,creationDate,base64,...)
Rest --> Service : SaleResponse

' Log on success
Service --> Json : logTicketInfo(ticketId, creationDate,\nvalidityDays, lineNumber)
Json --> Log : append JSON entry

' Publish base64 for Gate validation (optional but per system requirement)
Service --> Mqtt : publish validation/request\n{ticketBase64}
Mqtt --> Broker : MQTT publish
@enduml